{"unit_id":"Youngxj__dsh-ProjectModel#card-zh","repo":"Youngxj/dsh-ProjectModel","commit":"68789298dd2a572ac026ecebef106c542995611e","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-ProjectModel 是面向 DeepSeek Harness Web 客户端的项目组插件，可把多个项目文件夹组织起来，让 agent 在同一会话中按 folderId 跨目录查看和处理文件。它提供项目组及文件夹管理、文件读取与写入、目录列表、PowerShell 命令执行和 AGENTS.md 查看，并把项目组信息加入提示词。设置页可维护项目组，输入框上方显示当前项目状态；默认项目组和文件夹按工作区分别保存。适合需要在多个代码仓库间连续工作的开发者。需要已安装 DeepSeek Harness Web profile 和 pnpm，不需要额外 API 密钥。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:577","lib/index.js:608","lib/client.js:355"]}
{"unit_id":"Youngxj__dsh-ProjectModel#card-en","repo":"Youngxj/dsh-ProjectModel","commit":"68789298dd2a572ac026ecebef106c542995611e","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-ProjectModel groups project folders for work across repositories in one DSH web session. Its project tool reads and writes files, lists directories, runs PowerShell commands, and reads AGENTS.md. A settings page manages groups and a dock shows status. Requires a DSH web profile and pnpm.","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:577","lib/index.js:608","lib/client.js:355"]}
